[Unit]
Description=liuqin Qualcomm SSC sensor stack
Requires=liuqin-hexagonrpcd-sdsp.service
Wants=liuqin-ssc-sample-gate.service
After=liuqin-hexagonrpcd-sdsp.service
# iio-sensor-proxy is deliberately NOT boot-started here: a compositor only
# establishes its accelerometer claim at the moment the SensorProxy name
# appears on the bus.  A proxy that started earlier leaves every session
# claimless until a manual restart (2026-09-12 boot-0 root cause).  The first
# D-Bus caller activates the proxy on demand; the 90-liuqin-ssc.conf drop-in
# still orders the sample gate first.
